Native library bundled with applications that use the terminal (not part of
the Go binary; built from source, not committed):

- libghostty-vt, from Ghostty (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty) at
  commit 4a4fc017940bec38c93b278c10c6a18c591f3e63 — MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2024 Mitchell Hashimoto, Ghostty contributors. Built by
  tools/libghostty, which writes Ghostty's LICENSE beside the libraries;
  `gnui package` copies it into Contents/Resources/Licenses. term/ and
  rexui/terminal.go are our own code calling its C API.
